From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: Assign Orange Pi 5 DP clock to V0PLL

Give the VP2 DisplayPort path a dedicated PLL.
Keep GPLL available for its existing consumers.
Hardware verification remains pending.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-orangepi-5.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-orangepi-5.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-orangepi-5.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-orangepi-5.dts
@@ -99,3 +99,8 @@
 		remote-endpoint = <&dp0_in_vp2>;
 	};
 };
+
+&vop {
+	assigned-clocks = <&cru DCLK_VOP2_SRC>;
+	assigned-clock-parents = <&cru PLL_V0PLL>;
+};
